<!--
    Lunar New Year: two red lanterns hang over the G. A breeze from the left sets the small one swinging, then the big one,
    their tassels trailing behind, and they settle again; it nods a plum blossom sprig on the way and carries off a petal.
    Mandarins for luck sit under the G and gold sparkles twinkle. One 3.6s loop.

